+M:	Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/rockchip,cmd-panel.yaml
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-rockchip-cmd.c
